      "text": "Un Pokémon con questo robusto guscio può essere\nsempre sostituito, anche se sotto l’effetto di mosse\no abilità antifuga.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An item to be held by a Pokémon. This discarded\ncarapace enables the holder to switch out of battle\nwithout fail.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "丈夫で　硬い　ぬけがら。\n持たせた　ポケモンは　控えの\nポケモンと　必ず　いれかわれる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "结实坚硬的空壳。\n携带它的宝可梦必定可以\n和后备的宝可梦进行替换。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "En combate, esta concha desechada permite que el\nportador siempre pueda cambiarse por otro Pokémon\nque no esté combatiendo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    }
  ],
